{#
    A document of somebody else's, shown inside this one — a player, or a
    specimen card.

    Neither can be shown in a file of text, so what is left is where it is,
    and the specimen names the size it was measured at because that is what
    the card is evidence for. A card is not a document of the site and has no
    twin of its own: it is a rendering, and this is the one link in a twin
    that lands on a page.
#}
{%- autoescape false -%}
{%- if node.hasOption('specimen') -%}
[{{ node.option('title')|default('Specimen')|md_escape }} · {{ node.option('viewport') }}]({{ asset(node.url) }})
{% else -%}
[{{ node.option('title')|default(node.url)|md_escape }}]({{ node.url }})
{% endif -%}
{%- endautoescape -%}
